/E (The WMarketplace Inc. is a women-led business consulting and training company dedicated to advancing economic opportunities for women entrepreneurs and small business owners. Through partnerships with government agencies, corporations, nonprofits, and economic development organizations, The WMarketplace delivers programs focused on digital skills, e-commerce, exporting, and AI adoption. The company has supported thousands of women-owned businesses across the United States and internationally, including initiatives for underserved communities and Ukrainian women entrepreneurs. The WMarketplace combines research, education, and mentorship to help women build sustainable businesses, increase economic participation, and strengthen pathways to leadership and financial independence in the digital economy.)
